graph LR
    WBO["workbenches-operator"]

    %% Platform orchestration
    Orch["Platform Orchestrator<br/>(rhods-operator)"] -->|Helm render + CR projection| WBO
    GatewayConfig["GatewayConfig"] -.->|gatewayDomain via orchestrator| Orch
    MLflow["DSC MLflow component"] -.->|mlflowEnabled via orchestrator| Orch
    WBO -->|ConfigMap watch| PlatformCM["odh-workbenches-config<br/>ConfigMap"]

    %% Deployed operands
    WBO -->|deploys| KFNC["Kubeflow notebook-controller"]
    WBO -->|deploys| ODHNC["ODH notebook-controller"]
    WBO -->|deploys ImageStreams| NBImages["Notebook image manifests"]
    WBO -.->|deploys if v2 Managed| WSC["workspaces-controller v2"]

    %% Webhook-time dependencies
    WBO -->|get| HWP["HardwareProfile<br/>infrastructure.opendatahub.io"]
    WBO -->|queue-name label| Kueue["Kueue"]
    WBO -->|get ResourceClaimTemplate| DRA["Kubernetes DRA"]
    WBO -->|ServiceMonitor CRUD| PromOp["Prometheus Operator"]

    %% External / cluster dependencies
    WBO -->|REST / watch 6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    WBO -->|TLS profile| OCPAPIServer["OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io"]
    WBO -->|webhook certs, preferred| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-CA"]
    WBO -.->|webhook certs, fallback| CertManager["cert-manager"]
    Prometheus["Prometheus / cluster monitoring"] -->|scrape 8443| WBO

    %% Build / libraries
    WBO -.->|built with| Libs["controller-runtime v0.23.3<br/>client-go v0.35.3<br/>kustomize api v0.21.1<br/>openshift/api, library-go"]

    %% Manifest sources
    UpKF["red-hat-data-services/kubeflow@rhoai-3.6"] -.->|manifests| WBO
    UpNB["red-hat-data-services/notebooks@rhoai-3.6"] -.->|manifests| WBO
    UpWB["red-hat-data-services/workbenches@rhoai-3.6"] -.->|manifests| WBO

    style WBO fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff
    style Orch fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style GatewayConfig fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style MLflow fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style PlatformCM fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style KFNC fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style ODHNC fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style NBImages fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style WSC fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style HWP fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Kueue fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style DRA fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style PromOp fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style K8sAPI fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style OCPAPIServer fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style ServiceCA fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style CertManager fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Prometheus fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Libs fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style UpKF fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style UpNB fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style UpWB fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
